<title>USA: Exxon affiliates to build 2 China facilities.</title>
<headline>Exxon affiliates to build 2 China facilities.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exxon Corp said Thursday that its affiliates in China, Esso (Tianjin) Co Ltd and Esso (Zhejiang) Co Ltd, plan to construct their first two lube oil blending facilities in the People's Republic of China.</p>
<p>The two plants, each with a capacity of 250,000 barrels per year, will be located in Tianjin and Ningbo.</p>
<p>Construction work is expected to be completed in mid-1998.</p>
</text>
